  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Weapon\n  | name                     = Atonement\n  | basevalue                = 4,805pp\n  | weight                   = 8 lbs\n  | damage                   = 1.40[2d6] + 5 Slash, Good, Magic\n  | crit                     = 19-20 / x2\n  | type                     = Great Sword\n  | class                    = Slashing\n  | prof                     = Martial\n  | hand                     = Two-handed\n  | damagemod                = STR\n  | attackmod                = STR\n  | durability               = 170\n  | material                 = Steel\n  | hardness                 = 17\n  | minlevel                 = 12\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtC|BoE}}\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{Enhancement bonus|w|5}}\n* {{Holy}}\n* {{Immunity|Intercession Ward}}\n* {{Augment|Red}}\n  | quest                    = Inferno of the Damned\n  | chest                    = End Chest\n  | description              = The sword of a repentant soul, his pleadings of forgiveness sharpened and focused the blade.\n  | pic                      = Atonement shown.jpg\n  | picdesc                  = Atonement.png\n  | tips                     =\n* Popular for [[Cleric]]s to keep an Atonement equipped during the [[Ascension Chamber]] raid - even if they are not proficient with it - just to avoid the frequent intercession attacks from the respawning [[Quell]]s after the initial retreat of the [[Black Abbot]].\n* [[Quell]]s' intercession affects any caster with divine spells or spell-like abilities ([[Cleric]]s, [[Paladin]]s, [[Ranger]]s, [[Favored Soul]]s, and [[Druid]]s), including those from Divine Epic Destinies, [[Bladeforged]], and [[Morninglord]]s.\n}}",
